<title>LATVIA: Two yields down, two rise at Latvian T-bill sale.</title>
<headline>Two yields down, two rise at Latvian T-bill sale.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on Latvian Treasury bills showed a mixed direction at auction with yields on the two shortest-term bills falling but rising on the two issues of longer maturity paper on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of lats unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD    (LAST WEEK)   ISSUE   BID   SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day	 9.57	   9.79	 1.0    2.39   1.0</p>
<p> 91-day	10.23	  10.33	 1.25   2.30   1.25</p>
<p> Six-month   12.02	  11.97	 2.5    4.73   2.5</p>
<p> One-year    13.04	  12.95	 1.25   1.92   1.25</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
</text>
